From f79a413cfea771a354b6d8f2ab47bb9fdd181b72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fabrizio Catitti <fabrizio.catitti@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:09:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(voice): Back command

- RemoteKey.BACK, sent as a real Back press (falls back to the
  OnBackPressedDispatcher if nothing handles the injected key)
- TastoIndietroIntent: "torna", "tasto indietro", "schermata precedente" /
  "press back", "previous screen"
- Plain "indietro" / "go back" (no time) rewinds 10 s in the player and
  presses Back when no video is on screen; Back keeps the session listening

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQ7oit84w6xrrRhN57hYZw
