+| torna · tasto indietro · schermata precedente | the remote's Back button. Plain "indietro" (no time) also means Back when no video is on screen; in the player it rewinds 10 s |
 
-English, after "ask home tv to…": play *title* · up / down / left / right (· "down 3 times") · select / ok · pause · resume · skip forward 30 seconds · go back 2 minutes ·
+English, after "ask home tv to…": play *title* · up / down / left / right (· "down 3 times") · select / ok · press back / previous screen · pause · resume · skip forward 30 seconds · go back 2 minutes ·
